  "notes": [
    "Fully on from a 3.3 V logic output (rated at 2.5 V gate drive): a low-side switch for LEDs, relays, fans, small motors.",
    "Add about 100 kohm from gate to source so it stays off while the driving pin floats, and a series gate resistor (10-100 ohm) for fast edges.",
    "Inductive loads (relays, motors) need a flyback diode across the load.",
    "125 °C/W steady state: about 1 W at 25 °C ambient with good copper on the drain."
  ],
